## 8️⃣ Add Accessibility & SEO

| Feature | How to Implement |
|---------|------------------|
| **Semantic HTML** | Use `<header>`, `<main>`, `<footer>`, `<nav>` tags. |
| **Alt Text** | Provide meaningful `alt` attributes for images. |
| **Keyboard Navigation** | Ensure focus states are visible (`focus:outline-none`). |
| **Meta Tags** | Add `<meta name="description">`, `<meta property="og:title">`, etc. |
| **Structured Data** | Inject JSON‑LD for products (`<script type="application/ld+json">`). |

**Example:**

```tsx
// src/components/ProductCard.tsx (add structured data)
import { useEffect } from 'react';

export default function ProductCard({ id, title, price, imageUrl }: ProductCardProps) {
  useEffect(() => {
    const script = document.createElement('script');
    script.type = 'application/ld+json';
    script.text = JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Product",
      "name": title,
      "image": [imageUrl],
      "offers": {
        "@type": "Offer",
        "priceCurrency": "USD",
        "price": price.toFixed(2),
        "availability": "https://schema.org/InStock",
      },
    });
    document.head.appendChild(script);
    return () => document.head.removeChild(script);
  }, [id, title, price, imageUrl]);

  // ...rest of component
}
```

---

## 9️⃣ Optimize Performance

| Technique | Tool | Why It Helps |
|-----------|------|--------------|
| **Code Splitting** | Vite + dynamic imports | Loads only needed chunks per route. |
| **Image Optimization** | Vite plugin `vite-plugin-imagemin` | Reduces file size without quality loss. |
| **Lazy Loading** | `loading="lazy"` on `<img>` | Defers offscreen images until needed. |
| **Prefetching** | `rel="prefetch"` on `<link>` | Brings next page resources ahead of time. |
| **Cache Busting** | Vite’s hashed filenames | Forces browsers to fetch updated assets. |
| **Bundle Analysis** | `rollup-plugin-visualizer` | Identifies large modules to tree‑shake. |

**Example: Lazy Load Product Images**

```tsx
<img src={imageUrl} alt={title} loading="lazy" className="w-full h-48 object-cover" />
```

---

## 🔟 Testing Strategy

| Type | Tool | Coverage |
|------|------|----------|
| **Unit** | Jest + React Testing Library | Component logic, hooks |
| **Integration** | Vitest + Testing Library | API interactions, routing |
| **E2E** | Cypress | User flows (Add to cart → Checkout) |
| **Accessibility** | axe-core | WCAG compliance |

**Sample Unit Test**

```tsx
// src/tests/ProductCard.test.tsx
import { render, screen } from '@testing-library/react';
import ProductCard from '../components/ProductCard';
import { BrowserRouter } from 'react-router-dom';

test('renders product card with correct info', () => {
  render(
    <BrowserRouter>
      <ProductCard id="1" title="Test Product" price={19.99} imageUrl="/test.jpg" />
    </BrowserRouter>
  );

  expect(screen.getByText(/Test Product/i)).toBeInTheDocument();
  expect(screen.getByText(/\$19\.99/i)).toBeInTheDocument();
  expect(screen.getByRole('img')).toHaveAttribute('src', '/test.jpg');
});
```

---

## 🏁 Deployment Checklist

| Item | Tool | Notes |
|------|------|-------|
| **CI/CD** | GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, CircleCI | Automate lint, test, build, deploy. |
| **Hosting** | Vercel, Netlify, Cloudflare Pages | One‑click deployments, CDN. |
| **Environment Variables** | `.env.production`, `.env.local` | Keep secrets out of repo. |
| **HTTPS** | Let’s Encrypt via hosting provider | Automatic renewal. |
| **Analytics** | Plausible, Fathom, Google Analytics | Track conversions. |
| **Monitoring** | Sentry, LogRocket | Capture runtime errors. |

**GitHub Actions Example**

```yaml
# .github/workflows/deploy.yml
name: Deploy

on:
  push:
    branches: [main]

jobs:
  build-and-deploy:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4
        with:
          version: 8
      - run: pnpm install
      - run: pnpm run build
      - uses: amondnet/vercel-action@v20
        with:
          vercel-token: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_TOKEN }}
          vercel-org-id: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_ORG_ID }}
          vercel-project-id: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_PROJECT_ID }}
          vercel-args: '--prod'
```

---

## 🎯 Optional Enhancements

| Feature | Why Add It? | Implementation Hint |
|---------|-------------|----------------------|
| **Server‑Side Rendering (SSR)** | Faster initial load, SEO | Use Next.js or Remix |
| **Progressive Web App (PWA)** | Offline support, home‑screen install | Vite PWA plugin |
| **Internationalization (i18n)** | Global reach | `react-i18next` |
| **Dark Mode** | User preference | Tailwind’s dark mode + toggle |
| **Real‑Time Inventory** | Avoid overselling | WebSocket or SSE |
| **Payment Integration** | Checkout flow | Stripe Elements, PayPal SDK |
| **A/B Testing** | Optimize UX | Split.io, Optimizely |

